        "nobel_worthiness": "Superconducting nanowire detectors supplied exceptionally efficient, fast, low-noise photon counting that has enabled demanding quantum-optical experiments.",
        "attribution": "Gol'tsman is closely associated with the original detector breakthrough, with Nam a major developer of high-performance devices.",
        "maturity": "The detectors are highly reproducible and have become essential instrumentation in quantum communication and photonics.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The distinction between invention and the many subsequent device and systems advances warrants scrutiny."
